                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for jianyu &amp;lt;yujian@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/ab90c32f-ecc8-44ba-87dc-61921692c514" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/ab90c32f-ecc8-44ba-87dc-61921692c514&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_72e failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: trevis-24vm2 /usr/sbin/lctl get_param nodemap.c0.exports |
			grep -c fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:40:4523@tcp
CMD: trevis-24vm2 /usr/sbin/lctl nodemap_add -d -p c0 c1
CMD: trevis-24vm2 /usr/sbin/lctl nodemap_add_range --name c1 --range fd33:3981:3213:f020:0:5254:40:4523@tcp
trevis-24vm2: error: invalid ioctl: 000ce042 errno: 17: File exists
trevis-24vm2: nodemap_add_range: File exists
pdsh@trevis-76vm4: trevis-24vm2: ssh exited with exit code 1
 sanity-sec test_72e: @@@@@@ FAIL: add_range on c1 failed 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

